# anthropic_workspace (Data Source)

Fetches a single Anthropic Workspace by ID via the Admin API.

> **API**: `GET /v1/organizations/workspaces/{id}` (Admin API).
> **Auth**: Admin API key (`admin_api_key` / `ANTHROPIC_ADMIN_API_KEY`).
> **Beta header**: None.
> **Cost**: Free.

